{"seq":3,"slug":"balance-reconciliation","title":"储值负债对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/expiry-residual/balance-reconciliation","wordCount":1797,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"储值负债对账\">储值负债对账</h1><p>财务每个月会问一个问题：「我们账上欠用户多少钱？」这个数字如果和工程系统算出来的对不上，接下来的一周就会在找差异中度过。本文给出一个能把储值负债拆成可核桶的对账模型——它的价值不在于公式漂亮，而在于<strong>每个桶都能被指向具体流水</strong>，差异能被定位到行而不是被含糊解释为「统计口径不同」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-负债的四个桶\">核心概念：负债的四个桶</h2><p>储值业务的负债不是一笔，而是按状态分层的四笔，它们的会计含义与后续处理完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>桶</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>会计含义</th>\n<th>后续动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>A 发行未核销（Outstanding）</strong></td>\n<td>已售出、未兑换、未过期的卡与账户余额</td>\n<td>递延收入 / 储值负债</td>\n<td>等待核销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>B 已兑换未消费（Redeemed-Unspent）</strong></td>\n<td>卡已兑换入账户，但账户余额尚未用于支付</td>\n<td>同一负债，只是载体从卡变成账户</td>\n<td>等待消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>C 已过期未移交（Expired-Pending）</strong></td>\n<td>已过有效期但尚未移交政府或核销</td>\n<td>负债仍在（可能仍需赎回）</td>\n<td>移交或核销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>D 已移交无主财产（Escheated）</strong></td>\n<td>已按辖区规则移交政府</td>\n<td>负债转出，对应资金另走流程</td>\n<td>归档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四桶之和应当等于<strong>负债总额</strong>，而这个总额的来源是第 2 章<a href=\"../stored-balance/balance-ledger\">只追加流水</a>里的恒等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>负债总额</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>CREDIT</mtext></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>DEBIT</mtext></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>ADJUST</mtext></munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{负债总额} = \\sum_{\\text{CREDIT}} a_i - \\sum_{\\text{DEBIT}} a_i + \\sum_{\\text{ADJUST}} \\Delta_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">负债总额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3443em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CREDIT</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3443em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DEBIT</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3443em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ADJUST</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>CREDIT</code> 包括充值、兑换入账、退款入账；<code>DEBIT</code> 包括支付消费、休眠收费、移交核销；<code>ADJUST</code> 是人工调整。<strong>注意兑换入账同时是卡侧的 DEBIT 与账户侧的 CREDIT</strong>，它对负债总额没有净影响——这正是「卡是凭证、余额是账户」设计的会计价值：兑换只是负债换了个载体，不是负债的增减。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[卡侧流水] --&gt; D[桶 A: 发行未核销]&#10;    A --&gt;|兑换| E[卡侧 DEBIT]&#10;    E --&gt; F[账户侧 CREDIT]&#10;    F --&gt; G[桶 B: 已兑换未消费]&#10;    G --&gt;|订单支付| H[账户侧 DEBIT]&#10;    G --&gt;|休眠收费| I[DEBIT + 通知]&#10;    A --&gt;|过期| J[桶 C: 已过期未移交]&#10;    J --&gt;|移交任务| K[桶 D: 已移交]&#10;    G --&gt;|长期不动 + 移交任务| K&#10;    D --&gt; L[负债总额]&#10;    G --&gt; L&#10;    J --&gt; L\">graph TD\n    A[卡侧流水] --&gt; D[桶 A: 发行未核销]\n    A --&gt;|兑换| E[卡侧 DEBIT]\n    E --&gt; F[账户侧 CREDIT]\n    F --&gt; G[桶 B: 已兑换未消费]\n    G --&gt;|订单支付| H[账户侧 DEBIT]\n    G --&gt;|休眠收费| I[DEBIT + 通知]\n    A --&gt;|过期| J[桶 C: 已过期未移交]\n    J --&gt;|移交任务| K[桶 D: 已移交]\n    G --&gt;|长期不动 + 移交任务| K\n    D --&gt; L[负债总额]\n    G --&gt; L\n    J --&gt; L</pre><h2 id=\"对账的三方来源与差异定位\">对账的三方来源与差异定位</h2><p>真正能救命的不是算总额，而是<strong>三方对账</strong>：业务流水算出的余额、物化余额字段、外部资金流。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ReconciliationRow {&#10;  bucket: &#39;A_OUTSTANDING&#39; | &#39;B_REDEEMED_UNSPENT&#39; | &#39;C_EXPIRED_PENDING&#39; | &#39;D_ESCHEATED&#39;;&#10;  currency: string;&#10;  fromLedgerMinor: number;&#10;  fromSnapshotMinor: number;&#10;  deltaMinor: number;&#10;  sampleEntryIds: string[];&#10;  status: &#39;MATCH&#39; | &#39;MISMATCH&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function reconcile(period: Period, currency: string): Promise&lt;ReconciliationReport&gt; {&#10;  const fromLedger = await ledgerAggregate(period, currency);&#10;  const fromSnapshot = await snapshotSum(period.end, currency);&#10;  const rows = buckets(fromLedger, fromSnapshot).map((b) =&gt; ({&#10;    ...b,&#10;    deltaMinor: b.fromLedgerMinor - b.fromSnapshotMinor,&#10;    status: b.fromLedgerMinor === b.fromSnapshotMinor ? &#39;MATCH&#39; : &#39;MISMATCH&#39;,&#10;  }));&#10;  return { period, currency, rows, generatedAt: now() };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReconciliationRow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A_OUTSTANDING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'B_REDEEMED_UNSPENT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'C_EXPIRED_PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'D_ESCHEATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fromLedgerMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fromSnapshotMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deltaMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sampleEntryIds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MATCH'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MISMATCH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reconcile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReconciliationReport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fromLedger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ledgerAggregate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(period, currency);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fromSnapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> snapshotSum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(period.end, currency);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rows</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buckets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fromLedger, fromSnapshot).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    deltaMinor: b.fromLedgerMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.fromSnapshotMinor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    status: b.fromLedgerMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.fromSnapshotMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MATCH'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MISMATCH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { period, currency, rows, generatedAt: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sampleEntryIds</code> 是这份设计里最有用的字段：当 <code>deltaMinor !== 0</code> 时，报告必须能给出<strong>差异所在的流水样本</strong>。没有这个字段，对账工作会退化成人工翻数据库。实现方式是除了聚合之外，同时跑一遍增量比对（对每个账户比较流水聚合值与快照值），把不一致的账户取前 N 个作为样本。</p>\n<p><strong>对账必须按币种分列</strong>。第 2 章<a href=\"../stored-balance/multi-currency-balance\">多币种余额与礼品卡币种</a>已经说明展示折算不能参与对账；负债报表的总额折算需要用<strong>期末汇率或期间平均汇率</strong>并在报表上显式声明，与业务侧的即时折算严格分离。混用会导致每月差异随汇率波动，看起来像 bug 实际是口径错。</p>\n<p><strong>对账是只读的</strong>。对账任务发现差异时的正确动作是告警并落报告，<strong>绝不允许自动修账</strong>。任何修正都必须是一条冲正流水并带审批（见第 2 章第 1 篇的 <code>REVERSAL</code> / <code>MANUAL_ADJUSTMENT</code> 区分）。自动修账会把差异原因永久埋掉，下一个周期的差异会更大且更难定位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"移交任务的职责边界\">移交任务的职责边界</h2><p>桶 C 到桶 D 的迁移由移交任务执行，它必须满足三个条件才算合格：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function escheatBatch(tx: Tx, j: JurisdictionDecision, asOf: Date): Promise&lt;EscheatResult&gt; {&#10;  if (!j.escheatRequired) return { moved: 0, skipped: &#39;NOT_REQUIRED&#39; };&#10;  const candidates = await tx.accounts.findEscheatable(j.jurisdiction, asOf, j.dormancyDays);&#10;&#10;  let moved = 0;&#10;  for (const acc of candidates) {&#10;    const balance = await tx.ledger.balanceOf(acc.id);&#10;    if (balance &lt;= 0) continue;&#10;    await tx.escheatRecords.insert({&#10;      accountId: acc.id,&#10;      jurisdiction: j.jurisdiction,&#10;      amountMinor: balance,&#10;      currency: acc.currency,&#10;      ruleRef: j.ruleRef,&#10;      fromBucket: &#39;C_EXPIRED_PENDING&#39;,&#10;      at: asOf,&#10;    });&#10;    await tx.ledger.append({&#10;      accountId: acc.id,&#10;      direction: &#39;DEBIT&#39;,&#10;      amountMinor: balance,&#10;      currency: acc.currency,&#10;      source: { kind: &#39;EXPIRY_WRITE_OFF&#39;, policyRef: `${j.ruleRef}:escheat` },&#10;      idempotencyKey: `escheat:${acc.id}:${j.jurisdiction}:${asOf.getUTCFullYear()}`,&#10;      occurredAt: asOf,&#10;    });&#10;    moved += 1;&#10;  }&#10;  return { moved };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> escheatBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JurisdictionDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">asOf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">EscheatResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><sp